      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s fair. \n\nI was thinking whether we should keep this for loop here as a fast path. My reasoning was (this might be naive) that since we already have to do the work for `are_radius_check_predicates_valid`, then we could eat that cost at the beginning since it\u0027s a much faster check, before moving on to `are_radii_predicates_valid`.\n\nLet me know what you think",
      "parentUuid": "69ef0009_4f708180",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 878,
