        "id": 4623515
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-22T22:10:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t believe that\u0027s it. This test was meant to test two behaviors\n* a Fuzzed testcase where fBottom \u003e\u003e\u003e fTop and so fBottom - fTop \u003d fBottom because of FPL\n* an axis-aligned transform that collapses an SkRRect to empty bounds due to FPL (floating point loss)\n\nThese bugs are related but don\u0027t require each other to work, so I isolated these into two testcases.\n\nI also edited the numbers in the test to be as simple as possible for reproduction.\n\nI had gemini create a visualization of the first test case (doc is here https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QrgVflGa3W6Rv-wQqcK_UwrvfGUNbgPgo9IAfKaCe-w/edit?resourcekey\u003d0-JWycYE2ZedQv0-dAihQFmg\u0026tab\u003dt.0#heading\u003dh.7l1c9523ib96)",
      "parentUuid": "6a6e967c_cfdf6b6d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1788,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 1788,
        "endChar": 93
      },
      "revId": "54792636c72c4ed21fac8bf3bb12e2973c9c744d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7588dcaa_68c6da17",
        "filename": "tests/RoundRectTest.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1788,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T15:05:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Talking offline, what is currently happening is that `SkRect::MakeRectXY()` calls `SkRRect::isValid()` at the end of its adjustments. If it\u0027s still invalid, then it punts and sets itself to be a rect. When it\u0027s a rect, then `SkPath::RRect` marks itself as a rect type instead of a rrect type and so avoids the DeduceRRect codepath.\n\nWe agreed that fixing the isValid() check is the first step, but a longer term goal would be to improve the `scaleRadii()` function to be able to assert that it remains valid.",
      "parentUuid": "001f45a8_f752eb2e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1788,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 1788,
        "endChar": 93
      },
      "revId": "54792636c72c4ed21fac8bf3bb12e2973c9c744d",
